whisper: A countdown that uses two libraries.
whisper: Run it with: stellanova examples/clock.stella

use: time
use: maths

genesis:
  scrawl "Hello, it is ", the current hour, ":", two digits with the current minute, "."
  for each n from 1 to 3:
    scrawl 4 minus n, "..."
    wait 1 second
  scrawl "Done! That took about ", round (seconds since the start), " seconds."
and the universe said i love you

to two digits, given x (a number), returning text:
  if x falls below 10: return "0" plus x
  return x as text
and the universe said i love you
